Source common.tape
Output workflow.mp4
Env SCENE_FILE "Samples/prime_tactic.lean:2"
Source open.tape

Type ":7" Enter Type "gs" Sleep 300ms Type " h" Sleep 2500ms Type ",;"
Type ":11" Enter Type "gs" Sleep 300ms Type " h" Sleep 2500ms Type ",;"
Ctrl+B Right Sleep 500ms
Type "[" Sleep 2s
Type "[" Sleep 2s
Type "]" Type "]" Sleep 1s
Type "?" Sleep 3s
Escape Sleep 500ms
Ctrl+B Left Sleep 500ms
Type ":28" Enter Type "gs" Sleep 300ms Type " h" Sleep 4s
